      "message": "there is no way for the caller to know if this failed.  What should the proper operation be?  What could cause the getRoamingCapabilities to fail?  Should this then report that firmware roaming is not supported so the framework code can do the roams instead of relying on faulty firmware? or is this a sign that something major happened?  Do we need to restart anything?",
